	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t07r0101_infomationw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>すばやく　たくさん　おとどけ！
ヤマジ　カーゴ　サービス　です▼
ひこうきに　のって
フキヨセシティに　いかれますか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-26T04:58:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>すばやく　たくさん　おとどけ！
ヤマジ　カーゴ　サービス　です▼
飛行機に　乗って
フキヨセシティに　行かれますか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-26T04:58:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・飛行機に乗れる状態＝t07到着後から
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
・はい　→infomationw_03
　いいえ→infomationw_04</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-26T04:57:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>INFOMATIONW
汎用受付♀</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-26T04:57:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t07r0101_infomationw_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わかりました！　それでは
ひこうきに　のって　おまちください▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-26T04:57:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-26T04:57:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>わかりました！　それでは
飛行機に　乗って　お待ちください▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-26T04:57:30" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-26T04:57:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・はい選択時
・発着デモへ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
